# The server image needs cpp/, protocol/ and server/; the site web/ too, with the app's strings and times. Each of the
# app's files by its own name: the legacy builder lets nothing in under a wildcard here (a language added: its
# values-xx/strings.xml as a line of its own).
*
!cpp
!protocol
!server
!web
!android/app/src/main/res/values/strings.xml
!android/app/src/main/res/values-en/strings.xml
!android/app/src/main/res/raw/timing.json
web/node_modules
web/dist
web/build
web/engine-files
web/src/generated
web/scripts/__pycache__
cpp/build*
server/build
server/.gradle
server/.kotlin
protocol/build
**/.gradle
**/.kotlin
